This implementation is handwritten TypeScript/SQL. No prior-art repository or cookbook source was copied.
Generated _vendor files are copies of this repository's own canonical source, with a provenance header
and the documented zod import rewrite. Runtime dependencies retain their respective licenses.

Evaluation design references (ideas and attribution, not runtime or performance evidence):
- F. Maxwell Harper and Joseph A. Konstan (2015), The MovieLens Datasets: History and Context.
  https://doi.org/10.1145/2827872
- GroupLens MovieLens 100K: https://grouplens.org/datasets/movielens/100k/
  Raw data is not included. Review its terms before use or redistribution.
- RUCAIBox/LLMRank: candidate-order/history-order and popularity-bias evaluation motivation.
- sisinflab/Recommender-ChatGPT, Elliot and LensKit: offline-evaluation/baseline design references.
- TypeSafe rerank_typesafe cookbook: independent per-candidate Noul pattern, not proof of movie-taste quality.
  https://docs.typesafe.ai/cookbooks/rerank_typesafe
- infobip/crs-performance and sisinflab/LLM-MemoryInspector: repeatability and memorisation caveats.

No code was taken from repositories lacking a clear suitable license (including LLMForReRanking,
LLM4RS and LlamaRec); RecBole was treated as reading material only. No prior-art reported gain is a
measurement of this repository. All model/protocol/price references require activation-time verification.
